flowchart LR
  Claims[Claim records] --> Dossier[build_dossier]
  Hits[Search hits] --> Dossier
  Dossier --> DocsSec[What the documents say]
  Dossier --> WhySec[Why this is the answer]
  Dossier --> HowSec[How this answer was found]
  Dossier --> SrcSec[Sources with role and locator]
  Dossier --> AnsSec[Answer line with friendly title]
  WhySec --> Compact[Compact JSON dossier to LLM]
  AnsSec --> Compact
  Compact --> Check{violations and numbers match dossier?}
  Check -->|yes| Merge[Merge LLM Answer and Why with heuristic rest]
  Check -->|no| Heuristic[Use full heuristic brief]
  Merge --> SSE[answer_chunk then answer]
  Heuristic --> SSE
